	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ne pigeat pudeatque vos etiam multa sustinere <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>in causa illa iustissima iuris iurandi; agitur enim negotium <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>religionis nostrae sanctissimae et caput religionis attingitur, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>vera invocatio nominis dei et confessio, quisnam summus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ille, imo supremum nostrum bonum sit, quis adiuvet, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quis puniat.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Si deo coniungamus divos, abnega[vi]mus deum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>verum unicum illud praesidium nostrum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Si confessi fuerimus, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>confitebitur et ille nos vicissim.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Forma iuris<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>iurandi diserta est: "Ita me deus adiuvet et sancti <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>eius."</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Scio, quid vestrates intelligant per sancots; sed <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>illi, quibus fit iuramentum, non ita intelligunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Praeterea <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>certam nobis iurandi formulam praescripsit deus, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>quam violare non licet.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Ferent suum iudicium, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>qui adulantur magistratui et nobiscum colligere detrectant.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Vos perseverate in eo, quod coepistis.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Zuͦ <placeName ref="l21">Baden</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>hattend sich die <placeName ref="l894">4 Stett</placeName> underrett, den artickel vomm <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>puntschweren, so ferr und inn die andern Ort nitt <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>anzugind, ruͦwen ze lassen; aber bald daruff hatt <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>inn uwer bott anzogen, diewyl er deß ein ernstlich <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>bevelch.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Alls aber nitt jederman wolt gehällen in <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ein form zuͦ schweren, ist die sach im besten angestellt, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>das man sy sölle ruͦwen lassen und die pündt, diewyl <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>sy vor geschworen, trüwlich halten.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">utinam vestri <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>non reparent hanc litigandi materiam; audio enim (quam <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>verum sit, nescio) aliquot <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiorum</placeName> pagos et respublicas <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>missuros legationem <placeName ref="l781">Uriam</placeName>, <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName>, <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName>, <placeName ref="l441">Schaffhus<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ium</placeName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> postulatum, ut concorditer et ipsi <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>concedant in foedus <placeName ref="l832">Gallicum</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Hic ego metuo, quia vestri <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>subinde reparationem foederum urgent, ne reparent <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>etiam lites; nostrates enim, <placeName ref="l41">Bernenses</placeName> et alii quidam, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ut non recipient foedus <placeName ref="l832">Gallicum</placeName>, ipsam servitutem <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>et libertatis <placeName ref="l862">Helveticae</placeName> pestem, ita per sancots nunquam deo <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>iuvante iurabunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Dominus infringat conatus malorum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Non est, quod mireris de tomis meis; institui 3 <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>aedere, primum tantum vulgavi; iam laboro in 2.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Singuli absolventur 2 decadibus, ut in universum <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>futurae sint decades 6.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Si legisses, potuisses id <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>coniectare ex serie seu cohaesione.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Erunt vice locoru<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>m communium.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Dominus vires sufficiat, ut, quod in<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>stitui, perficiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Pro novis illis tuis magnas ago gratias.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Ex instituta <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>inquisitione <placeName ref="l875">Hispanica</placeName> apud <placeName ref="l808">Belgas</placeName> miseri <placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>si non insanirent, intelligerent, quam sibi clementiam <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>ex Caesare pollicerentur.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Sed sunt ista <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>abscondita ab oculis eorum, quia dominus affligere et <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>tentare eos instituit.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Dominus omnibus nobis oculos et <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>aures concedat.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Oremus pro fratribus afflictis <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>et pro nobis ipsis aliquando etiam affligendis et forte cit<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>ius, quam ipsi putemus.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> habeo non <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>ita segniter procedere religionis negotium, sed <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>bellum <placeName ref="l2524">Scoticum</placeName> et <placeName ref="l832">Gallicum</placeName> fervere pestilentius, quam <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>videatur futurum e <persName>re Anglorum</persName>, praesertim cum admittant <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Caesaris copias; periculum enim latens non potes non videre e<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>minus.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Oremus pro illis quoque dominum, ut custodiat illos a malo.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 25. i<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>ulii anno 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro D. <persName ref="p8418">Osvaldo Myconio</persName>, <placeName ref="l28">Bas<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>iliensis</placeName> ecclesiae antistiti vigilantissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>domino et fratri suo colendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
